  "details": "The brand new Avatar dynamic system has unlocked a lot more creative potential for players to play around with, but as it stands at the time of posting this we only have two shapes types: those being sphere and capsule. Although the capsule contacts are a bit broken at this time in order to save on the number of game objects needed to create sender contacts that match say a television screen it would be beneficial to have a box option to reduce the number of contacts users would put on their avatars and would enhance user creativity.",
